71146596128194_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=p2y7z358pEEQ7kNvwHAVFYD&_nc_oc=AdqZjl0UDFWNjrcIEqurmQENH6WImw9cJpPrNs-FWEwgwdt82DB6riqP9fy7v75w7BA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQPUMzcRien4EoqGZmZy5yCIzzoy9oBWMHVElDFFqTQeUw&oe=6AE1F439"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "2116332565928774", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499622315_2116332569262107_6472776043868426897_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HG1JoVxPH8kQ7kNvwGnHWzb&_nc_oc=AdqI1iJLyZpIL13u-dxqwNqO_aq8QU4yIcHbf3URhRB93vhJyD7FW-ZWngVqyORUnnM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNIkbwtZ1nsRpY-ynYd6r14qdovQK7_TVoYgDJgm7DlYw&oe=6AE20713"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "909457358817429", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499623558_909457362150762_5574869297430657880_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rm8KuOYdVP0Q7kNvwGg3Ex4&_nc_oc=Adpg05Q7x_rEJ20w-LVcpJz61RfFM0mypqkIgvhGxf5PQ4NJ55mmARGqE8XcmUjv7iQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNftsbI2dEGGdu9WzJt434iiIv1R4mmR_y-tSodhgBJvw&oe=6AE2055A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Wild", "keywords": ["social", "free", "hangout", "friends", "chat"], "long_description": "**Explore with friends.**\n\nWild is one big social space. Walk across the map, follow the noise, visit other players, or let your curiosity lead the way.\n\n**Life as a duck.**\n\nCustomize your duck avatar, and express yourself in ways only possible inside VR. Walk, run, or jump around with hand-based movement.\n\n**Welcome to the community.**\n\nWhen you join Wild, you\u2019re joining a new world that is constantly changing. Tune into events, changes to the map, or try out the latest cosmetics.\n", "short_description": "Wild is a social VR hangout world. Explore a shared city, meet friends, and host events."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https: